0..78 Comment "//! Representation independence of two structures with operations: the toggles"
79..127 Comment "//! of Sterling, Gratzer and Birkedal\'s counters"
128..209 Comment "//! [Sterling-2023-univalent_reference_types], § 5, `posCounter ≡ negCounter`,"
210..289 Comment "//! related along negation. Each operation is carried along the carrier\'s path,"
290..366 Comment "//! its argument moved back by the equivalence\'s backward map and its result"
367..442 Comment "//! forward by its forward map, and the carried operation is related to the"
443..522 Comment "//! other structure\'s by `Path.funext`. A reading carried between two different"
523..600 Comment "//! carriers, booleans tagged with unit and the booleans, is related the same"
601..609 Comment "//! way."
610..613 Comment "//!"
614..645 Comment "//! - see: #1747 — `untagged`"
646..700 Comment "//! - cites: [Sterling-2023-univalent_reference_types]"
701..704 Comment "//!"
705..862 Comment "//! [Sterling-2023-univalent_reference_types]: https://doi.org/10.4230/LIPIcs.CSL.2024.19 \"Sterling, Gratzer and Birkedal, Towards univalent reference types\""
